+H2 now selects ARGUS_DECISIONS_H2_RUNTIME=claude|codex, default claude. Codex requires an explicit ARGUS_DECISIONS_H2_MODEL; ARGUS_DECISIONS_H2_REASONING_EFFORT is optional and validated. gpt-5.6-luna / low is authenticated and verified for this account. This is independent of the feeder runtime and ARGUS_ANALYSIS_RUNTIME. Claude identity remains claude-cli; Codex records codex-cli, the exact requested model, and reportedModel=null when unavailable. Shared runner guards, costs, single-pass coordination and rolling limits remain in force across switching.
