+Code validation: 173 focused tests pass; contracts/server typechecks and server build pass. Full workspace typecheck is blocked by existing web iterable typing errors and a missing @vitejs/plugin-react installation. Two platform failures reproduce on the unmodified snapshot: escaped Windows artifact paths in state-isolation, and journal file-symlink privileges. See validation.json and the retained logs.
