+After approval, load the existing token through the PowerShell 7 profile without printing it. Confirm the current Argus process identity and that no workload is active. Run activate-codex.ps1 -CurrentProcessId <verified-current-id>. The script captures current configuration, restarts exactly that server from this branch with Codex H2, verifies enabled codex-cli/model status, and only then patches this feeder. It refuses a changed definition or cadence. Do not run another server alongside Argus. Launcher defaults remain Claude/Haiku.
