+After activation, wait for a real fixed-slot feeder run and the ten-minute maturity window; use refresh-evidence.mjs to require a matched scheduled Codex source run, Codex assessment/model, retained snapshot and clean report. Limits and competing passes can defer assessment. Review the selector command/result, task outcome and invocation controls. If the first live attempt fails, stop, retain actual logs and re-diagnose before a second fix. No live scheduled verification or provider calibration is claimed yet.
