+Rollback: restore the captured feeder using authenticated PATCH with runtime/model/reasoningEffort/phases from activation-before-pipeline.json; inspect and stop the verified current collector process, then run start-collector.ps1 -Runtime claude -Model haiku. Keep all run, ledger, journal and failed-attempt records. Do not reset collection start, caps or history.
